,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.6.dev5.official [f5918a9d3]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev5 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7680) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-13600KF (20 threads) - 47.84 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nSome PropertyEditors have different heights which is not a problem, but once they are put in the same row, for example put in a HBoxContainer, it becomes a problem.\n\n<img width=\"266\" height=\"282\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f2852829-3901-44e9-86b6-bef2d543950d\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a script, then copy this code to it. Then run (Ctrl+Shift+X) this script.\n```\n@tool\nextends EditorScript\n\nfunc _run() -> void:\n\tvar dialog = AcceptDialog.new()\n\tdialog.hide()\n\tdialog.confirmed.connect(dialog.queue_free)\n\tdialog.canceled.connect(dialog.queue_free)\n\tdialog.close_requested.connect(dialog.queue_free)\n\t\n\tvar vbox = VBoxContainer.new()\n\tdialog.add_child(vbox)\n\t\n\tvar hbox = HBoxContainer.new()\n\tvbox.add_child(hbox)\n\t\n\tvar foo = Foo.new()\n\tvar props = foo.get_property_list().filter(func(v): return v.name == \"option\" or v.name == \"a\")\n\tfor p in props:\n\t\tvar editor = EditorInspector.instantiate_property_editor(foo, p.type, p.name, p.hint, p.hint_string, p.usage)\n\t\teditor.label = p.name\n\t\teditor.size_flags_horizontal = Control.SIZE_EXPAND_FILL\n\t\thbox.add_child(editor)\n\t\n\tEditorInterface.popup_dialog_centered(dialog, Vector2i(500, 500))\n\t\nclass Foo:\n\t@export_enum(\"A\", \"B\") var option: String\n\t@export var a: String\n\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNA","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://a